OL,3,GNEWSALetter of the law: X mistaken for
OL,4,AK in parking mix-up
OL,5,
OL,6,FOne letter made all the difference for
OL,7,Fa man who received a string of parking
OL,8,Fcharges after an enforcement camera
OL,9,Fmistook the X on his number plate for a
OL,10,FK.
OL,12,FStephen Cheeseman, from Stilton in
OL,13,FCambridgeshire, said he received six
OL,14,Fcharges over the last six months, all
OL,15,Ffor the car park at the Dragonfly Hotel
OL,16,Fin Peterborough.
OL,23,APub: 07-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
