OL,3,GNEWSALetter of the law: X mistaken for
OL,4,AK in parking mix-up
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe 71-year-old "panicked" when the
OL,7,Ffirst parking charge was posted to him
OL,8,Fin February. But photographs provided
OL,9,Fby Civil Enforcement Ltd showed a
OL,10,Fdifferent make of car entering the
OL,11,Fsite.
OL,13,FCheeseman said the parking company has
OL,14,Fapologised and promised "it won't
OL,15,Fhappen again". The BBC has approached
OL,16,FCivil Enforcement Ltd for comment.
